<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:02:35Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>朝鮮發佈金正恩照片：為何他的死亡傳言總是捲土重來？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1zr53y80o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T14:58:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1zr53y80o/trad--7cbddbcd570f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1zr53y80o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在未經證實的傳言傳開後，朝鮮官媒發布了這位獨裁者與其女兒的照片。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國下令政府系統禁用DeepSeek：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>香港演員鍾雪瑩、袁澧林發聲之後，她們親述被性別冒犯的經歷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T04:37:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad--b44a6d14686f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqly0v0xnxdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC中文訪問了四位來自不同行業的女性，了解言語冒犯是如何在工作環境中出現；當性別冒犯被包裝成「玩笑」，她們是如何應對。</summary></entry><entry><title>翻看英國統計 為何從未吸煙的人也開始對電子煙上癮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:02:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T00:17:33Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad--619daa0b0a2c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmp3gepg90x6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">根據英國國家統計局（ONS）數據，目前有超過100萬名電子煙使用者過去從未吸煙。</summary></entry><entry><title>法國騷亂：巴黎局部宵禁 被劫商品現身二手平台</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwp9g811d5ydo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T02:47:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwp9g811d5ydo/trad--b3e56de32de5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwp9g811d5ydo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">此前，法國內政部長承認，警方在一些城市「失去了控制」。</summary></entry><entry><title>緬甸軍政府：英王查爾斯贈書昂山素季</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd93yyzx2g8o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T09:20:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd93yyzx2g8o/trad--786637a9d601.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd93yyzx2g8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">內比都罕有公布昂山素季接收這些書籍及一封密封信件的照片。</summary></entry><entry><title>在實體商店購物很令我心煩——為什麼我只在網上購物</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63elnjkg03jo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:02:35Z</updated><published>2026-10-21T00:17:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63elnjkg03jo/trad--76c2d3eeda4e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63elnjkg03jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">英國服飾零售巨頭Primark首次將推出宅配服務，以應對Shein等超快時尚競爭。網上零售佔比持續上升，專家稱退貨政策成關鍵。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯境內反普京破壞行動的隱秘世界</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09dpdn294o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T01:14:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09dpdn294o/trad--9bdca7ec971e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6d09dpdn294o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">兩名男子講述了他們聲稱在戰爭期間為烏克蘭情報部門提供支援所從事的工作。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我擔心得不敢去中國了」：韓國脫北者接連收到警方赴華警告</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd6dgj9jwp8o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-17T12:54:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd6dgj9jwp8o/trad--f0359e5428ca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmd6dgj9jwp8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">為何已在韓國定居的脫北者，如今對前往中國感到憂慮？BBC深入了解韓國警方發出旅遊警告的背景，以及脫北者實際遭中國當局拒絕入境的個案。</summary></entry><entry><title>澳洲國會議員遭汽車「蓄意」撞擊重傷： 我們目前所知情況</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yngleml15o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T03:13:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yngleml15o/trad--626ab0336f54.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yngleml15o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">海倫·海恩斯（Helen Haines）遭汽車撞擊，澳洲總理稱此為一起「蓄意行為」。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國三季度增長4.5% 但出口暴增，樓市新開工面積暴跌</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqdjv2vw9n4po/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T09:19:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqdjv2vw9n4po/trad--d08d9d1d729d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqdjv2vw9n4po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">分析人士向BBC指出，中國依賴單一外需引擎的風險正在累積，北京的刺激空間有限，未必願意、也未必有能力在這個時點大舉加碼。</summary></entry><entry><title>尊界V800「煞車門」：從產品安全之爭到「恨國」論戰</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmje5y4254qdo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T03:22:46Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmje5y4254qdo/trad--5f881090f570.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmje5y4254qdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">華為尊界V800煞車踏板斷裂爭議迅速升溫，從產品安全問題延伸至「速成車」質疑、中美汽車技術比較，以及民族品牌形象之爭。隨著官媒下場評議，事件進一步演變為一場輿論與產業敘事的角力。</summary></entry><entry><title>《孤獨的美食家》：一個人吃飯，為什麼能紅遍全亞洲？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T09:37:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad--61c836c7fe01.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6x2wvlxqjr8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">開播至今14年，《孤獨的美食家》從日本深夜劇成長為風靡亞洲的電視作品。觀眾跟隨主角井之頭五郎穿梭街巷尋找美食和故事。主演松重豐希望讓更多海外觀眾透過美食認識日本文化。</summary></entry><entry><title>美沙冬是毒還是藥？從香港經驗看台灣選戰戒毒爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T08:57:18Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad--3e0e93250f10.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmwyq699de35o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台北市長選舉引發對「美沙冬」（香港稱「美沙酮」）與毒品減害政策的論戰，然而在海峽對岸的香港，這項計劃已運作超過半世紀。為什麼醫學界將其視為有效降低犯罪與血液傳染病的「減害」關鍵？</summary></entry><entry><title>新鴨綠江大橋閒置12年終開通：中朝關係回暖？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:46:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad--fac779159e2d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm0e0q5dp3lyo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國與朝鮮的鴨綠江大橋，在閒置12年之後終於正式開通。近年朝鮮與俄羅斯關係愈走愈近，專家分析中方需要透過開通大橋鞏固對朝關係，也被視為關係回暖的象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣AV盛極而衰：中國市場如何催生這場成人片熱潮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-08T09:37:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad--38da8fdcbc19.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqlymyyze8mjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣曾被視為亞洲唯一能合法拍攝無碼成人影片的地區，並在2020年前後快速擴張。隨著片商「麻豆傳媒」停運，外界開始質疑這波繁榮是否與中國市場及博弈資金有關。</summary></entry><entry><title>薄熙來前搭檔受查：重慶政壇「不倒翁」黃奇帆是誰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T14:46:38Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad--7b329579f173.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c83vq5lwy6wlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中共中紀委宣佈，已退出政壇多年的前重慶市長黃奇帆涉嫌「嚴重違紀違法」，正接受調查。此消息正值中共五中全會前夕，引發外界關注。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普排除美中合作開發人工智能</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:39:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad--fb69b70800e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統繼續拒絕為人工智慧設立監管措施的呼籲，認為這將扼殺人工智慧的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普習近平峰會：沒有說出口的議題可能更重要</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T03:48:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad--249695977d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮峰會最耐人尋味之處，或許在於中美兩國領導人沒有說哪些事，以及我們至今仍不知道哪些事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>在美中國研究生涉毒害越南同學：大學與家屬怎麼說？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg08d0glp7o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:31:53Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg08d0glp7o/trad--cdb291b8461c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6vg08d0glp7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國懷俄明大學一名越南籍研究生的家屬向BBC表示，受害人在辦公室的咖啡機內發現神經毒劑後，至今仍出現疲倦、食慾不振及睡眠欠佳等健康問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>矽谷這座城市垃圾太臭居民受不了 就讓科技來幫忙</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5kgl32d8443o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T00:08:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5kgl32d8443o/trad--0dcf7f19b160.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5kgl32d8443o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">垃圾場和工業設施散發的氣味正受到更嚴格的監測，但這有幫助嗎？</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉2026：贏會贏在哪裏，輸會輸在哪裏？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad--14c6dc46283f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lyezge4xywo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC深入分析將界定特朗普總統任期最後兩年的選舉前景，包括關鍵民調、選戰以及議題。</summary></entry><entry><title>從今以後，不擇手段？普京新策略要讓烏克蘭全國片瓦無存</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T09:09:43Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad--f930cb1fb79d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwm235qpgrrdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從學校、醫院、酒店、數據中心、火車到橋樑，俄羅斯近數星期加強以導彈和無人機襲擊烏克蘭首都及其他主要城市，攻擊民用目標。</summary></entry><entry><title>令人窒息的有毒霧霾蔓延東南亞，誰之過？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T00:20:23Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad--574ceaf17d79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cjkge2k03kgpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對被指控在印尼焚燒土地的企業，以及未能阻止這些行為的當局，人們的憤怒情緒正不斷升高。</summary></entry><entry><title>遊艇上的水上滑梯、泳池：衛星影像揭示的金正恩「夏宮」生活</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:31:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad--0bc0150d063e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9dzq7z7vw8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC追蹤了一艘長達80米、配有水上滑梯的船隻，旨在進一步了解金正恩如何度過假期——這對大多數朝鮮人而言，是遙不可及的體驗。</summary></entry><entry><title>石油出口放緩之際 霍爾木茲海峽輪船遇襲案件創新高</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2vky9ky0no/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T11:44:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2vky9ky0no/trad--0dc49909270d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx2vky9ky0no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC事實查核（BBC Verify）對英國海事機構數據的分析顯示，過去一星期內有12艘船隻遭到襲擊。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國製造的玩具如何從工廠到美國？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2d65npyrdjo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T00:27:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2d65npyrdjo/trad--904bb526e85b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm2d65npyrdjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">聖誕節臨近，我們追蹤兒童玩具從中國工廠到美國貨架的整個過程。</summary></entry><entry><title>中朝新鴨綠江大橋通車：北京、平壤與莫斯科的新格局</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T11:39:24Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad--010dc4677c88.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">連接中國丹東與朝鮮新義州的新鴨綠江大橋建成12年後正式通車。大橋此前遭長期閒置，被觀察人士視為中朝關係起伏的一個象徵。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉解讀：「北藍南綠」的政治版圖是否「鐵板一塊」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T03:36:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad--e4c721debfd7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n07pkpk5ggo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「北藍南綠」是描述台灣政治版圖的常見概念，但近年選舉結果顯示，這樣的區域分野並非一成不變，中間選民的流向在這次地方選舉可能左右大局。</summary></entry><entry><title>我們的廣告提到了「懷孕」 結果給 Instagram 下架了</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr1ex0l8l9z5o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-19T00:08:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr1ex0l8l9z5o/trad--c32e91ab55b2.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr1ex0l8l9z5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">創作者們表示，她們在社群媒體上發布女性健康內容時遭到了「秘密封鎖」，這背後究竟發生了什麼事？</summary></entry><entry><title>「我申請了200份工作」——用AI「撒網」求職為何易弄巧成拙？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gwv8gv5o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-18T00:32:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gwv8gv5o/trad--657a0d83de2b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz65gwv8gv5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">研究發現越來越多畢業生利用人工智慧在求職申請中編造個人資訊。但有人認為他們別無選擇。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我今年12歲，該嘗試蛋白粉嗎？」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgl3re7mnpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-16T09:28:44Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgl3re7mnpo/trad--5568a26dfd87.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqkgl3re7mnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC詢問專家，兒童和青少年服用蛋白質補充劑是否安全。</summary></entry><entry><title>減肥針「微劑量」用藥漸成風潮：注射少量真的安全嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T06:09:59Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad--7673e2d42b97.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckp8gd38100ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一些人正以小劑量方式使用「胰妥讚」、「週纖達」等GLP-1類藥物。使用者表示，這種方法既能幫助減重，又能減少副作用和節省開支。不過，專家指出，目前幾乎沒研究證據支持這種做法，而且可能存在危險。</summary></entry><entry><title>人類身高的起伏變化：哪些歷史事件影響最大？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-21T05:01:32Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:26:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad--d25b147665fc.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly388njx3go/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如今我們的身高比100年前高了大約10厘米，但這並非一帆風順。</summary></entry></feed>
